#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/01-runbook.md:212
#: 85802f8854b1408691eefbdec0346c0b
msgid ""
"After XML edits: `fs_cli -x reloadxml`. Directory and dialplan changes "
"apply on the **next** call. `sofia profile internal rescan` applies "
"supported profile data and reparses gateways, domains, and aliases, but "
"does not rebind `sip-ip`, `sip-port`, TLS, `ws-binding`, or `wss-"
"binding`; restart the profile or process for those changes. ACL lists "
"need `reloadacl`. `reloadxml` does **not** load/unload modules — use "
"`load` / `unload` / `reload mod_name` ([Chapter "
"5](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/module-"
"loading/))."
msgstr ""
"修改 XML 后运行 `fs_cli -x reloadxml`。号码簿和拨号计划更改会在**下一通**呼叫生效。`sofia profile "
"internal rescan` 会应用支持的配置档数据并重新解析网关、域和别名，但不会重新绑定 `sip-ip`、`sip-port`、TLS"
"、`ws-binding` 或 `wss-binding`；这些更改需要重启配置档或进程。ACL 列表需要 "
"`reloadacl`。`reloadxml` **不会**加载/卸载模块——使用 `load` / `unload` / `reload "
"mod_name`（[第 5 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/module-"
"loading/)）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/01-runbook.md:214
#: 9901fd324ad54c29a338017caa8d0736
msgid ""
"Vanilla SIP ports (`conf/vanilla/vars.xml`): internal **5060** / TLS "
"**5061**, external **5080** / TLS **5081**. RTP default range "
"**16384–32768** (`src/switch_rtp.c`; commented overrides in "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml`). Docker also documents "
"UDP **64535–65535**."
msgstr ""
"Vanilla SIP 端口（`conf/vanilla/vars.xml`）：内部 **5060** / TLS **5061**，外部 "
"**5080** / TLS **5081**。RTP 默认范围 "
"**16384–32768**（`src/switch_rtp.c`；`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml`"
" 中有注释掉的覆盖项）。Docker 还记录了 UDP **64535–65535**。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/01-runbook.md:216
#: bbc480b9a7464ca0bd628b8314c7ad8d
#, fuzzy, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Directory users **1000–1019** exist under `conf/vanilla/directory/` with "
"shared password `1234` (`$${default_password}` in `vars.xml`) — do not "
"expose 5060/8021 on a public IP. First-call numbers (`9196` echo, `4000` "
"voicemail, …): [Quick Start](../0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md)."
msgstr ""
"`conf/vanilla/directory/` 下存在分机 **1000–1019**，共享密码 `1234`（`vars.xml` 中的 "
"`$${default_password}`）— 不要把 5060/8021 暴露到公网 IP。首呼号码（`9196` 回声、`4000` "
"语音信箱等）见 [快速开始](01-quick-start.md)。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/01-runbook.md:218
#: f2c196f9a1734efe81fdacfa122f701c
msgid "Debugging Notes"
msgstr "调试说明"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/01-runbook.md:220
#: ad399be41f58450f8dd31601faae3179
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**CLI / ESL**: `fs_cli` first. If it cannot connect, the process is down,"
" ESL is not on 8021, `mod_event_socket` did not load, **or the source IP "
"failed the Event Socket ACL**. Default client target is loopback "
"(`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`). TCP that opens then closes with `text/rude-"
"rejection` / `Access Denied, go away.` is ACL, not “port closed” — "
"[Remote Event Socket ACL](#remote-event-socket-acl)."
msgstr ""
"**CLI / ESL**：先用 `fs_cli`。若连不上，则进程未起来、ESL 不在 8021，或 `mod_event_socket` "
"未加载。客户端默认目标是回环（`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/01-runbook.md:221
#: 89fa3b3c4ee340049c84658800988a1e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Runtime / SIP**: `$PREFIX/log/freeswitch.log` and console mappings. "
"Follow **one leg** by channel UUID ([Follow one call by channel UUID"
"](#follow-one-call-by-channel-uuid)). SIP trace: `fs_cli -x \"sofia "
"profile internal siptrace on\"` (keybinding 10 in "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml`). NAT surprises: you "
"started without `-nonat`."
msgstr ""
"**运行时 / SIP**：`$PREFIX/log/freeswitch.log` 与控制台映射。SIP 跟踪：`fs_cli -x "
"\"sofia profile internal siptrace "
"on\"`（`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml` 中快捷键 10）。NAT "
"异常：启动时未加 `-nonat`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/01-runbook.md:222
#: ea389df8cfa14443a785e6343f177812
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Data / persistence**: core scoreboard is SQLite under `$PREFIX/db/` "
"(`src/switch_core_sqldb.c`). `show channels` / `show calls` read that "
"projection; the session thread is source of truth ([Data and "
"API](../1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md)). Wipe `*.db` only while "
"stopped."
msgstr ""
"**数据 / 持久化**：核心记分板是 `$PREFIX/db/` 下的 "
"SQLite（`src/switch_core_sqldb.c`）。`show channels` / `show calls` "
"读的是该投影；会话线程才是真相来源（[数据与 API](05-data-and-api.md)）。仅在停止后清理 `*.db`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/01-runbook.md:224
#: c95450fd3fc6421dbba6ad2d8251df42
msgid ""
"Log verbosity: `fs_cli -x \"console loglevel debug\"`; file logger maps "
"`all` to `console,debug,info,notice,warning,err,crit,alert` in vanilla "
"`logfile.conf.xml`. Rotate: `fs_cli -x \"fsctl send_sighup\"` (`rotate-"
"on-hup` is `true`)."
msgstr ""
"日志详细程度：`fs_cli -x \"console loglevel debug\"`；文件记录器在 vanilla "
"`logfile.conf.xml` 中把 `all` 映射到 "
"`console,debug,info,notice,warning,err,crit,alert`。轮转：`fs_cli -x \"fsctl "
"send_sighup\"`（`rotate-on-hup` 为 `true`）。"

